  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you’re planning to apply for a </span><b>work visa for Dubai</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2026, you need updated information. Rules changed in 2025. Unlimited contracts are gone. All employment contracts are now fixed-term. Cost ranges have shifted. New visa categories like the Blue Visa have launched. And the Salama system now handles renewals using AI.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This guide breaks down the latest types, eligibility rules, process, and cost,&nbsp; clearly and practically. No outdated steps. No confusion. Just what actually applies in 2026.</span></p>\n<div class=\"lwptoc lwptoc-autoWidth lwptoc-baseItems lwptoc-light lwptoc-notInherit\" data-smooth-scroll=\"1\" data-smooth-scroll-offset=\"24\"><div class=\"lwptoc_i\">    <div class=\"lwptoc_header\">\n        <b class=\"lwptoc_title\">Contents</b>                    <span class=\"lwptoc_toggle\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"lwptoc_toggle_label\" data-label=\"show\">hide</a>            </span>\n            </div>\n<div class=\"lwptoc_items lwptoc_items-visible\">\n    <div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\"><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Types_of_Work_Visa_for_Dubai_Which_One_Is_Right_for_You\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Types of Work Visa for Dubai, Which One Is Right for You?</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Who_Can_Apply_for_a_Dubai_Work_Visa_Eligibility_Criteria\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Who Can Apply for a Dubai Work Visa, Eligibility Criteria</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Documents_Required_for_a_Dubai_Work_Visa\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Documents Required for a Dubai Work Visa</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#How_to_Apply_for_a_Work_Visa_for_Dubai_Step-by-Step_Process\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">How to Apply for a Work Visa for Dubai, Step-by-Step Process</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Dubai_Work_Visa_Cost_and_Processing_Time_2026\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Dubai Work Visa Cost and Processing Time (2026)</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#What_Happens_If_Your_Dubai_Work_Visa_Is_Rejected_or_Overstays\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">What Happens If Your Dubai Work Visa Is Rejected or Overstays</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Key_Benefits_of_a_Work_Visa_for_Dubai\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Key Benefits of a Work Visa for Dubai</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Final_Thoughts\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Final Thoughts</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#FAQs_for_work_visa_for_Dubai\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">FAQs for work visa for Dubai</span>\n    </a>\n    </div></div></div>\n</div></div><h2 id=\"types-of-work-visa-for-dubai-which-one-is-right-for-you\"><b>Types of Work Visa for Dubai,&nbsp; Which One Is Right for You?</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There are five main </span><b>types of work visa in Dubai</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> under the broader Dubai employment visa system. Each serves a different purpose.</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Visa Type</b></td>\n<td><b>Validity</b></td>\n<td><b>Sponsor Required</b></td>\n<td><b>Best For</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Standard Work Visa</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 Years</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employer</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full-time employees</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Green Visa</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5 Years</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freelancers, self-employed</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Golden Visa</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10 Years</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Investors &amp; skilled professionals</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blue Visa</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Long-term</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sustainability professionals</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Remote Work Visa</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1 Year</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Overseas employees</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Now let’s break them down.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"standard-work-visa-2-year-employment-visa\"><b>Standard Work Visa (2-Year Employment Visa)</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is the most common <a href=\"/work-visa-for-dubai/\">Dubai work visa</a>.</span></p>\n<p><b>Who it’s for:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Employees hired by a UAE-registered company</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span> <b>Validity:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 2 years, renewable</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Since January 2025, all employment contracts must be fixed-term. Unlimited contracts are no longer valid.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your employer handles the entire process,&nbsp; from work permit approval to residence stamping. You cannot apply for this visa yourself.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"green-visa-5-year-self-sponsored-visa\"><b>Green Visa (5-Year Self-Sponsored Visa)</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This visa gives professionals more independence.</span></p>\n<p><b>Who it’s for:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Freelancers and self-employed individuals</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span> <b>Validity:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 5 years</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span> <b>Sponsor:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Not required</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It offers a 180-day grace period after cancellation, which is longer than other visa types.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A minimum income threshold applies. You must prove financial stability to qualify.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"golden-visa-10-year-long-term-residency\"><b>Golden Visa (10-Year Long-Term Residency)</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is Dubai’s premium long-term residency option.</span></p>\n<p><b>Who it’s for:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Investors, highly skilled professionals, artists, educators, healthcare workers, content creators, e-sports professionals</span></p>\n<p><b>Validity:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 10 years</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2025–2026 updates expanded eligibility. Nurses with 15+ years at Dubai Health, educators, podcasters, and sustainability professionals now qualify.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You sponsor yourself. No employer control.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"blue-visa-sustainability-climate-professionals\"><b>Blue Visa (Sustainability &amp; Climate Professionals)</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Introduced in 2025, this visa is missing from most older guides.</span></p>\n<p><b>Who it’s for:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Experts in climate change, environmental science, renewable energy</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It allows long-term stay without a local sponsor. It is fully self-sponsored and targets sustainability leaders.</span></p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-10253 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Work-visa-for-Dubai-e1778835011192.webp\" alt=\"Work visa for Dubai\" width=\"727\" height=\"542\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-10253 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Work-visa-for-Dubai-e1778835011192.webp\" alt=\"Work visa for Dubai\" width=\"727\" height=\"542\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Work-visa-for-Dubai-e1778835011192.webp 727w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Work-visa-for-Dubai-e1778835011192-300x224.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 727px) 100vw, 727px\"></noscript></p>\n<h3 id=\"remote-work-visa-digital-nomad-virtual-working-programe\"><b>Remote Work Visa (Digital Nomad / Virtual Working Programe)</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This visa allows you to live in Dubai while working for a foreign company.</span></p>\n<p><b>Validity:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 1 year, renewable annually</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span> <b>Minimum income:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> USD $3,500 per month</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">January 2026 update: Bank statement requirement increased from 3 months to 6 months.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This visa does not lead to permanent residency.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"who-can-apply-for-a-dubai-work-visa-eligibility-criteria\"><b>Who Can Apply for a Dubai Work Visa,&nbsp; Eligibility Criteria</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding </span><b>Dubai work visa requirements 2026</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is critical before applying.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Minimum age: 18</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Standard working age: 18–60</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Workers over 65 trigger additional employer fees</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Valid job offer from UAE-registered employer (unless self-sponsored under Green, Blue, Golden visas)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Minimum education: High school diploma for Standard visa</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bachelor’s degree usually required for Golden Visa</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Profession must match company’s licensed activity</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Passport must be valid for at least 6 months</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employer must have a clean legal and compliance record</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Note for Indian nationals:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Visa-on-arrival now applies if you hold valid residency from Australia, Canada, Japan, New Zealand, South Korea, or Singapore.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"documents-required-for-a-dubai-work-visa\"><b>Documents Required for a Dubai Work Visa</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Preparing correct </span><b>Dubai work visa documents</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> prevents delays.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You will need:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Passport (original + copy, 6 months validity minimum)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Biometric passport photos (white background, high resolution)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Signed fixed-term job contract</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry permit issued by <a href=\"/mohre-inquiry-services/\">MoHRE</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID application form</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical fitness certificate from UAE-approved clinic</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attested academic certificates (UAE Embassy + Ministry of Foreign Affairs)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employer documents (trade license, company card)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Health insurance confirmation (mandatory in Dubai; employer covers it)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"document-tips-that-prevent-rejection\"><b>Document Tips That Prevent Rejection</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All applications are fully digital in 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Handwritten forms or incomplete uploads are rejected.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Scans must be clear and readable. Blurred files stall the entire process.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Documents not in English or Arabic require certified translation.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-apply-for-a-work-visa-for-dubai-step-by-step-process\"><b>How to Apply for a Work Visa for Dubai,&nbsp; Step-by-Step Process</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you’re searching </span><b>how to apply for Dubai work visa</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, follow this structure.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"stage-1-work-permit-and-entry-permit\"><b>Stage 1,&nbsp; Work Permit and Entry Permit</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your employer applies for a work permit through MoHRE.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Free zone companies must first secure quota approval based on office space.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once approved, an entry permit is issued.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Validity:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">60 days (Standard and Green Visa)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">6 months (Golden Visa)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"stage-2-medical-test-and-emirates-id\"><b>Stage 2,&nbsp; Medical Test and Emirates ID</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You must complete a medical test at a government-approved clinic.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tests include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HIV screening</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hepatitis B (role-dependent)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">TB chest X-ray</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Positive infectious disease results lead to visa refusal and deportation. This rule is strict. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You then complete Emirates ID biometrics: photo and fingerprints.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"stage-3-labour-contract-insurance-and-residence-visa\"><b>Stage 3,&nbsp; Labour Contract, Insurance, and Residence Visa</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Within 14 days of medical clearance, your employer uploads the final labour contract to the MoHRE portal.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Health insurance is mandatory in Dubai and paid by the employer.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The <a href=\"/uae-residence-visa/\">residence visa</a> is now digital. Physical passport stamps are being phased out.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Salama system uses AI to process renewals. Processing is significantly faster compared to previous years.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"already-in-dubai-how-to-switch-status\"><b>Already in Dubai? How to Switch Status</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you’re on a tourist visa, you can convert it to employment status through “change of status.” In most cases, no exit is required. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Alternatively, you can exit and re-enter through a border run.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"dubai-work-visa-cost-and-processing-time-2026\"><b>Dubai Work Visa Cost and Processing Time (2026)</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><b>Dubai work visa cost</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> depends on category and profession.</span></p>\n<p><b>Total range:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> AED 5,000–9,000</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This covers:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Work permit fee</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry permit</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical test</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"/emirates-id-status/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Residence visa issuance</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Under UAE Labour Law, employers must cover Standard Employment Visa costs.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"/dubai-golden-visa/\">Golden Visa</a> upgrade fees are paid by the applicant.</span></li>\n<li><b>Processing time:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 2–4 weeks end-to-end.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Salama system has significantly reduced renewal processing time.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Workers over 65 require employers to pay an additional AED 5,000 every two years.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"what-happens-if-your-dubai-work-visa-is-rejected-or-overstays\"><b>What Happens If Your Dubai Work Visa Is Rejected or Overstays</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding risks protects you.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"common-rejection-reasons\"><b>Common Rejection Reasons</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Missing or unclear documents</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employer quota limitations (common in free zones)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employer compliance issues with MoHRE</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical test failure</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Profession mismatch with company activity</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"overstay-fines-2026-update\"><b>Overstay Fines,&nbsp; 2026 Update</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Overstay fines now start immediately at visa expiry.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Penalty: AED 50 per day.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The previous informal grace period has been removed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unpaid fines automatically block residence renewals.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Grace period after cancellation:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">60 days for most categories</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 days for specific employment cases where MoHRE registration was incomplete</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"key-benefits-of-a-work-visa-for-dubai\"><b>Key Benefits of a Work Visa for Dubai</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here’s why professionals choose Dubai:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tax-free income</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Legal access to banking, housing, and healthcare</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Family sponsorship starting from AED 4,000 monthly salary</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Upgrade path from Green Visa to Golden Visa</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID serves as primary government and financial ID</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"final-thoughts\"><b>Final Thoughts</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To move forward, you need to decide three things:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Which visa type matches your situation.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether your employer handles the process or you apply independently.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your realistic timeline for approval and relocation.</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before submission, get your documents reviewed properly. <a href=\"/\">KPM PRO</a> can check your paperwork, confirm eligibility, and prevent rejection delays before you file your 2026 application.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"faqs-for-work-visa-for-dubai\"><b>FAQs for work visa for Dubai</b></h2>\n<h3 id=\"q1-how-much-does-a-work-visa-for-dubai-cost-in-2026\"><b>Q1: How much does a work visa for Dubai cost in 2026?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Between AED 5,000 and AED 9,000 depending on visa type and profession.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q2-how-long-does-it-take-to-get-a-work-visa-in-dubai\"><b>Q2: How long does it take to get a work visa in Dubai?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Usually 2–4 weeks from work permit approval to residence activation.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q3-can-i-sponsor-my-family-on-a-dubai-work-visa\"><b>Q3: Can I sponsor my family on a Dubai work visa?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Minimum salary requirement typically starts at AED 4,000 per month.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q4-can-i-convert-a-tourist-visa-to-a-work-visa-in-dubai\"><b>Q4: Can I convert a tourist visa to a work visa in Dubai?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Most cases allow in-country status change without exit.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q5-what-is-the-difference-between-the-green-visa-and-a-standard-work-visa\"><b>Q5: What is the difference between the Green Visa and a Standard Work Visa?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Green Visa is self-sponsored for 5 years. The Standard visa requires employer sponsorship for 2 years.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q6-what-happens-if-i-overstay-my-dubai-work-visa\"><b>Q6: What happens if I overstay my Dubai work visa?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You pay AED 50 per day. Fines accumulate immediately after expiry.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q7-is-the-unlimited-employment-contract-still-valid-in-the-uae\"><b>Q7: Is the unlimited employment contract still valid in the UAE?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No. Since January 2025, all employment contracts must be fixed-term.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"q8-who-qualifies-for-the-dubai-golden-visa-in-2026\"><b>Q8: Who qualifies for the Dubai Golden Visa in 2026?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Investors, skilled professionals, educators, long-serving healthcare workers, content creators, and sustainability experts.</span></p>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How much does a work visa for Dubai cost in 2026?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Between AED 5,000 and AED 9,000 depending on visa type and profession.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How long does it take to get a work visa in Dubai?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Usually 2–4 weeks from work permit approval to residence activation.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I sponsor my family on a Dubai work visa?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes. Minimum salary requirement typically starts at AED 4,000 per month.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I convert a tourist visa to a work visa in Dubai?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes. Most cases allow in-country status change without exit.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What is the difference between the Green Visa and a Standard Work Visa?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"The Green Visa is self-sponsored for 5 years. The Standard visa requires employer sponsorship for 2 years.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What happens if I overstay my Dubai work visa?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"You pay AED 50 per day. Fines accumulate immediately after expiry.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Is the unlimited employment contract still valid in the UAE?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"No. Since January 2025, all employment contracts must be fixed-term.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Who qualifies for the Dubai Golden Visa in 2026?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Investors, skilled professionals, educators, long-serving healthcare workers, content creators, and sustainability experts.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script><!-- Simple Share Buttons Adder (8.5.6) simplesharebuttons.com --></p>\n<div class=\"ssba-modern-2 ssba ssbp-wrap aligncenter ssbp--theme-8\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<ul class=\"ssbp-list\">\n<li class=\"ssbp-li--facebook\"><a data-site=\"facebook\" class=\"ssba_facebook_share ssba_share_link ssbp-facebook ssbp-btn\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?t=Work%20Visa%20for%20Dubai%20(2026):%20Types,%20Costs,%20Step-by-Step%20Process&amp;u=/work-visa-for-dubai/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#4267B2; background-color: #4267B2; height: 48px; width: 48px; \"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"#fff\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\">\n  <g>\n    <path d=\"m21.7 16.7h5v5h-5v11.6h-5v-11.6h-5v-5h5v-2.1c0-2 0.6-4.5 1.8-5.9 1.3-1.3 2.8-2 4.7-2h3.5v5h-3.5c-0.9 0-1.5 0.6-1.5 1.5v3.5z\"></path>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<p></p></span><span class=\"color-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\">\n  <path fill=\"#3B5998\" d=\"M10.7,10.7 L15.7,10.7 L15.7,15.7 L10.7,15.7 L10.7,27.3 L5.7,27.3 L5.7,15.7 L0.7,15.7 L0.7,10.7 L5.7,10.7 L5.7,8.6 C5.7,6.6 6.3,4.1 7.5,2.7 C8.8,1.4 10.3,0.7 12.2,0.7 L15.7,0.7 L15.7,5.7 L12.2,5.7 C11.3,5.7 10.7,6.3 10.7,7.2 L10.7,10.7 Z\"></path>\n</svg><br>\n</span>\n<div title=\"Facebook\" class=\"ssbp-text\">Facebook</div>\n<p></p></a></li>\n<li class=\"